  "content": "<h1>沉浸式快捷栏</h1>\n<p>本模组通过为放置方块、拾取方块以及使用工具和武器添加动画效果，使静态的快捷栏变得更加沉浸。</p>\n<h2>✨ 功能特性</h2>\n<p>🔄 拾取、使用或切换物品时，快捷栏栏位带有动画效果</p>\n<p>💬 切换物品或悬停时显示动态提示框</p>\n<p>🎨 可根据用户偏好配置弹性/缩放动画样式</p>\n<p>✨ 经验条升级及升级特效动画！</p>\n<p>⚙️ 支持通过游戏内配置文件进行自定义设置。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyacl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/qhk3fk.png\" alt=\"需要 YACL\"></a></p>\n<h2>🧩 兼容性</h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fheld-item-info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">手持物品信息</a></strong>、<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbedrockify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">基岩化</a></strong> 和 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fitem-borders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品边框</a></strong> 自 1.1.0 版本起已获支持！！</p>\n<h2>⚒️ Forge 开发进度</h2>\n<h3>目前支持：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Neoforge 1.21.1, 1.21.9-1.21.11</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>计划中：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Forge 1.20.1 支持</li>\n<li>Neoforge 1.21.2-1.21.4, 1.21.5, 1.21.6-1.21.7 支持</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>展示</h2>\n<p><strong>平滑拾取 || 弹性拾取 || 弹性放置 || 平滑放置</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/29d87f87965c88799367936a4cf79b99837262d6.gif\" alt=\"动态拾取\"> \n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4334135d81ecfb09b070afb19a75a5000eef3fbc.gif\" alt=\"弹性预览\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3811f8d98117701e9f6c4a92bcf9725b0966555f.gif\" alt=\"弹性放置\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/455fb5f360c628d7f41708a89974c9930500c307.gif\" alt=\"平滑放置\"></p>\n<h3>平滑快捷栏滚动</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/60865e0c4e5a35bad178fda9605ee5e6616663e1.gif\" alt=\"平滑快捷栏展示\"></p>\n<h3>弹性快捷栏滚动</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/159cc06c18e26fdd600c83b13b8dabb3e2986e36.gif\" alt=\"弹性快捷栏展示动图\"></p>\n<h3>动态提示框</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b70dc0f3c01e81d667ee7dbd64793546464d2793.gif\" alt=\"动态提示框\"></p>",
